WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:07,940
Master Zhao, what happened to you after eating?

2
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:13,020
I thought it would be fine if you had a fever

3
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:14,990
Are you feeling uncomfortable anywhere in your body?

4
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:18,980
feel much more comfortable

5
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,590
Everyone relaxed

6
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,430
Was it the woman in front of me who did it?

7
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:25,270
How do I greet you? My name is Zhang Yun.

8
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,510
If you have anything, you can call me

9
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,070
Eat these again

10
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:32,430
I asked Master Zhao to do it first

11
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:33,390
It won’t taste good when it’s cold.

12
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,670
Master Zhao is a serious hotel chef.

13
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:38,230
You are so good at your craftsmanship. I will help you up.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,440
Eat more to regain your strength
